      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA AURORA (3) is a quick dog who thrives over the short dashes. Faded to finish fifth over 520m at Q Parklands (30.39) in a Grade 5 but is better placed coming back in trip. Strike rate this distance strong having won seven of 11 tries. Has a very good strike-rate from this draw, with three wins from four starts. Looks the one to beat on her best form. HEATLEY HAYZE (1) has a strong record this track and trip with seven wins and six placings from 18 starts. Was out of the placings last time (20.01) at this track in a Grade 4, finishing fourth and beaten 5.5 lengths. Looks suited here and can measure up. HOLD THE GAVEL (2) has a strong record this journey here with six wins and a minor from 11 starts. Below best last time at Q Parklands (30.95) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 17 length seventh. Looks a key chance on best figures. FROM A DISTANCE (8) boasts a solid strike-rate over this track and distance.",
